{
  "sheet": "towers",
  "about": "Every buildable tower. Arma towers use base-game Arma 3 classes; BTD towers are cartoon monkeys built from coloured spheres. Real projectiles are deleted on firing and damage is scripted; every shot draws a coloured streak (fx_rgba) to its bloon.",
